## 📖 About
This repository contains my **Python learning notebooks**, from the very basics (variables, loops) to **OOP**, **NumPy** and **Pandas**. Every notebook has short notes plus runnable examples and practice questions.

## 🗂️ Topics Covered
| 🔢 Module | 📚 Notebooks | 💡 What's Inside |
|:--|:--|:--|
| **Basics** | `veriables`, `type casting`, `string formating` | Data types, conversions, `.format()` and f-strings |
| **Control Flow** | `if else, indexind`, `elif`, `for loop`, `while loop` | Conditions, indexing & slicing, loops, patterns |
| **Data Structures** | `list`, `set and dictionary` | append, remove, set operations, key-value pairs |
| **Functions** | `user define`, `parameter vs arguments`, `BUILT IN FUNCTION` | Custom functions, positional arguments, built-ins |
| **OOP** | `oops`, `Encapsulation`, `Inheritance`, `Method overriding , Overloading , Super function` | Classes, objects, access modifiers, inheritance types, `super()` |
| **Data Science** | `Numpy,array,dim`, `pandas` | Arrays, dimensions, Series, DataFrames |
| **Practice** | `practice question`, `test questions` | Logic building and hands-on exercises |

## 🚀 Mini Projects
- 🤖 **Chatbot** (`yashika/CHATBOT.ipynb`) is a simple command-based chatbot using a `while` loop and `input()`.
- 🧩 **Custom Module** (`yashika/black.py`) is a reusable module with a function to calculate the average of a list, imported in `yashika.ipynb`.

